### 1. Add the first item to cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/carts/add-items
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: VerySecretApiKey123

{
  "sessionId": "MY_AWESOME_SESSION_124",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}

###

### 2. Add another item to the same cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/carts/add-items
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: VerySecretApiKey123

{
  "sessionId": "MY_AWESOME_SESSION_123",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 2,
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}

###

### 3. Turn the cart into an order
# Dikkat: Bu istek başarılı olursa veritabanındaki sepet silinir ve stoklar kalıcı olarak düşer.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/from-cart/MY_AWESOME_SESSION_123
x-api-key: VerySecretApiKey123

###

### 4. View order details
# (Yukarıdaki 3. adımdan dönen "id" değerini aşağıdaki URL'nin sonuna yazmalısın. Örn: .../orders/1)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1
x-api-key: VerySecretApiKey123

###

### 5. Create an order without a cart
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: VerySecretApiKey123

{
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": 1,
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ]
}
